A||||7||Rodney||Wheel center stickers for aftermarket rims||||1||
Z||000000||Rodney||10-13-2001||08:12 PM||||I have had more than a few requests thru the years from people looking for wheel center stickers in larger diameters for aftermarket rims. So I am looking to have some made in 2.25", 2.50", 2.75" and 3". I will have the logos made slightly smaller so one can trim the OD some to get a slightly smaller size also. I will do the in just the Fiero logo. No Fiero GT. I am looking for input on the color choice. I wonder if I should do them with a black logo on silver background or a silver logo on a black background. I will only do one style. Black logo on silver background or silver logo on black background. Looking for the most popular color combination before I get them made. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||California Kid||10-13-2001||08:21 PM||||Rodney.... Just a suggestion: You might want to consider a clear (UV safe) base with a black Winged Horse (no border shield). That way any color on the wheel will show thru (or they can paint the zone under the decal their choice of color, before application). Just a thought.<p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 10-13-2001).]||||reg||1
