Z||000003||Old Lar||10-13-2001||08:57 PM||||You can buy them from Rodney.  I have some sets for when I repace my center hubs with plain new ones add Rodney's stickers looks like original.  (almost, cause I got the GT ones)||||reg||1
Z||000004||Alex4mula||10-13-2001||09:39 PM||||I was one of those who asked. I needed them in 2.5". What I ended up doin was making a 2.5" black decal and instaling yours (red on black background) on top. Result was awesome, specially because the car is all red with black details. Many people ask me if those are Fiero factory rims.<BR>Now, if you are going to make only one color I would prefer silver on black background. That will give it a deeper look. Very soon I may need those. When will they be available?<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red & White (:||||reg||14
